   "body": "Fixed on `fix/3541-redact-local-hostname` (8a62db2a13eb2b347fd1c257a9339afafbfb04b4):\n\nAn address like `user@host.local` (an mDNS hostname, not a mail\naddress) was masked and counted as an email. The `realEmail` function\nin `internal/redact/redact.go` now rejects hosts ending with `.local`\nTLD, which are system-assigned mDNS names, not mail domains.\n\nTest: existing redact tests pass (97 passed). The test for\n`admin@build.local` was updated to no longer expect it as an email.",
   "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
